#!/bin/sh /etc/rc.common
# 金维 SoftAP 周期调和：开机后每 60s reconcile（有上行关；断网开）
START=99
STOP=10
USE_PROCD=1

start_service() {
	procd_open_instance
	procd_set_param command /bin/sh -c 'while true; do /usr/sbin/jinwei-softap-ctl reconcile; sleep 60; done'
	procd_set_param respawn 3600 5 0
	procd_close_instance
}
